omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2mtLnhzDsbgQ7kNvwHqlVFC&_nc_oc=Adp_ro4qqHaxDl45qeTWAwMxfU9-YfGMLShjYQyrGwRObhxq7xaGp_3XaCSwOtRiEvM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0JBDZv7-SM2NuH_M-Huksrqu4ZGiBqflhyWng-7_I6vg&oe=69D39774"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Joqy5EcYSJgQ7kNvwHtbJ15&_nc_oc=AdoAaZg5ASNucIBXH4I77FgN4_gfWcfvDz02EwW2Q-ECA7pgcNZGrWcnFtBW86Urk58&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af23NTJbTNHHP3sYSyoNod1KhvGh8h_wi-NYFGKiVnAOTg&oe=69D398D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2TBOi50SgTUQ7kNvwGFFAY1&_nc_oc=Adq9ZGY80mU6Puz8KH8DiEMW13ZLFFVCczxaYZUHxrIoUaKQqJHhrC2ysnfIR6nR0GQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1c_sbD0CILZkLwODSpI0hL_rdJdcTafUL2Vrftt1LQnA&oe=69D3ADF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://